Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:48.64,opjp1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\an9\3c&278BD3&\blur4}甘神でいて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:42.64,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&999944&\blur4}对轻咬示好的小猫们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:48.46,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&7744CB&\blur4}哄一哄 我们由此相视而笑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:54.63,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&55BA79&\blur4}如果我们永远如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:57.66,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}该是多么平静
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.66,0:03:00.18,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&278BD3&\blur4}可是爱意袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.22,0:03:03.99,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}催人越发急躁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:06.80,opcn1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&999944&\blur4}「要选谁呢？」
